[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>With the ignition key in the OFF position,\ndisconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2892245\">7050A90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892208\">7040L14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891243\">1040A20</a></p><p>1. Use wrench (1a) to unscrew lock-nut (1b).</p><p>2. Remove fuel pump (2a) together with fuel level gauge  control\n(2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.736.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033936.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the float valves and pipes.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033937.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<p>1. Break collar (1a) and remove pipe (1b) connected to the vapour\nseparator.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033938.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the vapour separator connection pipe\nand secure using a new collar.</p><p>Fit the float valves and pipes.</p><p>Fit the fuel pump.</p><p>Use the appropriate tool to tighten the\nlock-nut securing the pump in its housing to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.736.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ring nut</p></td><td><p>SUBMERGED FUEL PUMP RING NUT</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>6</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891243\">1040A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892208\">7040L14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892245\">7050A90</a></p><p>With the ignition key in OFF position,\nconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div>"],[1,63,524288,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891740\">4450B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891243\">1040A20</a></p><p><a hr